      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Add callsigns",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Type the callsigns, one per line. Tap <strong>Add</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/1cc45298657981b3.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Copy the device names",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Each phone gets a name like <code>RECON1@J2LA9U8O</code>. Copy it: you give it to the phone in your MDM.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/42442282c4586d46.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Open enrolment",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>When the phones are ready, tap <strong>Open for 24 hours</strong>. Until then, no phone can enrol.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/3dee350ee9443e58.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Enrolment is open",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>It closes itself after 24 hours. Tap <strong>Close now</strong> to end it sooner.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/4ad413bea68c1462.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Reject a device",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Planned one by mistake? Tap <strong>Reject</strong>. That phone can then never enrol, and its callsign is spent.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/f24dd19fe68552c6.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
